type: software
title: "Applied HPC with R: C++, Parallelism, and Performance"
abstract: >-
  A free, open-source book on high-performance computing with R: profiling,
  writing efficient code, parallel computing with the parallel package, running
  R on Slurm clusters, and speeding up R with C++ and Rcpp. Available in
  English and Spanish.
